LOCATION:HC Mainstage Theatre 1411 E 11th Ave\, Ybor City Tampa \, FL 3360
 6 United States
DESCRIPTION:The HC Performing Arts Series presents Forces of Nature Dance 
 Theatre on October 9 10 at 7:30 pm at the HC Mainstage Theatre\, Ybor City
 . One of New York Citys leading professional dance companies\, Forces of N
 ature fuses modern\, traditional African\, and hip-hop dance with live dru
 mming\, spoken word\, and bold visual design. Founded in 1981 by Abdel R. 
 Salaam\, the company has performed in 34 states and around the world\, fro
 m The Kennedy Center to Johannesburg. Tickets are 23 general admission\\\;
  free to HC students\, faculty and staff with I.D. \n\nPermalink: https://
 www.tampa.gov/node/194806
