SUMMARY:PD13 Street Legal
LOCATION:13605 N 22nd st Tampa \, FL 33613 United States
DESCRIPTION:Looking for free resources to support you and your family? PD1
 3 Street Legal is here to help! Hosted by the Hillsborough County Public D
 efenders Office on the third Saturday of every month\, Street Legal connec
 ts community members with FREE legal services\, healthcare\, employment as
 sistance\, financial services\, and housing resources through our trusted 
 community partners. This October\, were excited to partner with the Tax Co
 llectors MILES bus and Tampa Family Health Centers to bring even more reso
 urces directly to our community\, including healthcare services and conven
 ient access to ID and vehicle registration services. Everyone deserves acc
 ess to the resources they need to thrive. Join us\, connect with our commu
 nity partners\, and take advantage of these FREE services. We hope to see 
 you there! \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/196326
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196326
