SUMMARY:Coptic Stitch Journal Making
LOCATION:211 South Howard Ave Tampa \, FL 33606 United States
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an afternoon of bookmaking with one of the earliest form
 s of bookbinding  The Coptic Stitch Binding. Its also one of the first bas
 ic bindings that bookmakers learn. In this step-by-step workshop you will 
 create your own Coptic Stitched Journal\, from making the cover using hand
 made and printed papers\, to folding your signatures to stitching your pag
 es together. The exposed spine and hard cover create a beautiful space to 
 hold your sketches\, pressed flowers\, special notes\, favorite quotes and
  other treasures. Well add an extra special touch with partial signature c
 overs\, allowing your cover design to continue throughout the inside of yo
 ur journal. When were done\, youll take home your personal journal\, a per
 fect place for you personal thoughts and special notes. All supplies are i
 ncluded with your choice to mixed media paper or drawing paper for your jo
 urnal pages. No prior experience is needed. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tam
 pa.gov/node/196711
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196711
END:VEVENT
