SUMMARY:15th annual A Night at the Museum
LOCATION:801 Water Street Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:For 15 years\, A Night at the Museum has brought the community
  together for a family-friendly Halloween celebration at the Tampa Bay His
 tory Center. Join us on Saturday\, October 24 \, as we celebrate the 15th 
 annual A Night at the Museum with an afternoon of trick-or-treating\, cand
 y\, crafts\, games\, entertainment and costumed characters throughout the 
 museum. Families can trick-or-treat at candy stations\, meet costumed char
 acters\, and take part in games and crafts\, all surrounded by the stories
  of Floridas past. Photo opportunities throughout the museum add to the fe
 stive spirit\, with every floor offering a new surprise. Timed entry begin
 s at 2 p.m.\, with the final entry at 5 p.m. Select your ticket based on y
 our preferred entry time. Members save 15 on event tickets during both pre
 sale and public sale. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/196191
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196191
END:VEVENT
