SUMMARY:Think Ahead: Brain Health for Every Generation
LOCATION:3624 Causeway Boulevard Tampa \, FL 33619 United States
DESCRIPTION:Brain health looks different at every stage of life. The habit
 s a child builds today\, the pressures midlife brings to focus and the cha
 nges that surface in our retirement years are all parts of the lifelong st
 ories of our brains. How do diet\, sleep and exercise impact our long-term
  cognitive health? When is a headache actually a warning sign of a more se
 rious problem\, and how can you tell? What should caregivers know about th
 e realities of caring for a loved one with a neurological disorder? In thi
 s free community conversation held by the Tampa Bay Times and AdventHealth
 \, discover practical guidance and tools to protect your brain health and 
 help support the people you love. Plus\, access on-site resources from com
 munity health and caregiving organizations across Tampa Bay. \n\nPermalink
 : https://www.tampa.gov/node/196111
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196111
END:VEVENT
