SUMMARY:Oktoberfest Tampa 2026
LOCATION:600 N. Ashley Drive Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Oktoberfest Tampa on The Tampa Riverwalk The festival of Gemtl
 ichkeit returns for the 17th Annual Oktoberfest Tampa event. For 3 full da
 ys\, Tampas downtown Curtis Hixon Waterfront Park will be transformed into
  the citys largest\, waterfront biergarten. Soak in the sprawling downtown
  views and beautiful sunsets\, as the park buzzes with live music\, dancin
 g\, dirndls and lederhosen\, and the bratwurst and schnitzel your heart de
 sires! All pre-sale tickets purchased for previously scheduled event dates
  are honored and valid. This year\, the event is excited to host its VIP g
 uests inside the Tampa International Airport VIP Lounge. VIP guests will e
 njoy a private bar and seating space\, as well as table side service\, coo
 ling fans\, AC Restrooms\, complimentary refills of your Stein\, Knigs Fea
 st\, prime viewing of live music\, and more. A full authentic Bavarian foo
 d hall will be available\, as well as a variety of Oktoberfest style beers
  from Green Bench and Coppertail are offered around the festival grounds. 
 Oktoberfest Tampa is the home of the Outrageous Bavarian Games that are al
 l free to play and guests can win fun prizes\, medals and more importantly
 \, bragging rights. Important Highlights: FRIDAY 1030: Keg Tapping with Fr
 an Haasch and Special Guest on Opening Day\, October 30th  4:00pm SATURDAY
  1031: Oktoberfest Tampa hosts Outrageous Bavarian Games Main Stage compet
 itions with Mr. Mrs. Oktoberfest Tampa\, the regions largest Beard Mustach
 e Competition and is adding a new Krampus dance from the Schuplattler grou
 p for a special performance on Halloween night SUNDAY 111: Keg Tapping wit
 h Tampa Bay Lightning on FAMILY DAY - Sunday\, November 1st  1:00pm Every 
 year\, entrance to the event is free for men and women of the Armed Forces
  (active or retired) and any first responders of the City of Tampa (TPD\, 
 TFR\, EMS) for you and your spouse. Simply show your proper ID at the entr
 y gate. 21 up event. Kids 12 under are free\, but MUST be accompanied by a
  parent. Oktoberfest Tampa has its own unique KINDER ZONE with GiGi and Fr
 iends entertainment stage\, The Barrymore Hotel Kinder Pumpkin Patch that 
 offers free pumpkin painting\, there is also free face painting for kids a
 nd a free art wall to contribute artistic expression to. CURTIS HIXON WATE
 RFRONT PARK Fri.\, Oct 30th: 4:00pm -11:00pm Sat.\, Oct 31: 11:00am - 11:0
 0pm Sun.\, Nov 1: 11:00am - 6:00pm \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/no
 de/196451
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196451
END:VEVENT
