SUMMARY:The Halloween Party 2026
LOCATION:2010 N Avenida Republica de Cuba Tampa \, FL 33605 United States
DESCRIPTION:This Halloween\, step inside one of Tampas most iconic and not
 oriously haunted landmarks for an unforgettable night of music\, mystery\,
  and mayhem. On Saturday\, Oct. 31\, the historic Cuban Club transforms in
 to The Hollywood Undead\, a cinematic noir experience inspired by Tampas g
 hostly past. Explore multiple indoor and outdoor spaces as you dance the n
 ight away with Tampa Bays hottest DJs\, encounter mysterious undead charac
 ters\, and experience Halloween entertainment to die for. Whether youre a 
 longtime fan or joining us for the first time\, this is THE Halloween even
 t you wont want to miss. As with every 13 Ugly Men event\, your attendance
  helps us continue our mission to PartyWithAPurpose (https:www.facebook.co
 mhashtagpartywithapurpose?__cft__0AZik1-Mlenwltdqu4o_nV9wwMPBQ_Bk_K7NAl4Dz
 v_oV0TCAFcX-jkkwAfQ3aj8lttUJccBL9geAD2L9pqbONkzWaleOq79wEiPjtYkouvqszdVLdl
 EiuCPhlykmOopPcxzI __tn__q)\, supporting organizations that make a differe
 nce throughout the Tampa Bay community. Costumes are highly encouraged. \n
 \nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/194706
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/194706
END:VEVENT
