 he festival creates a welcoming place for people to connect\, learn and ce
 lebrate together. Presented by the Ghanaian Association of Tampa Bay\, Gha
 na Fest Florida 2026 promotes cultural awareness\, unity and meaningful co
 nnections across Tampa Bay and beyond. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.go
 v/node/195856
