  this class offers a space to develop meaningful\, hands-on skills and a d
 eeper understanding of the craft. Firing costs\, essential tools\, and gla
 zes included. Clay available for purchase separately in studio. \n\nPermal
 ink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/193751
