  title is Tampa Theatre: A Century of Stories by Andrew T. Huse. Shelley B
 lood will serve as the reviewer for this months discussion. Visit the Muse
 um Store to purchase your copy. Grab a cup of coffee and join us monthly f
 or an informal discussion about the best in Florida literature. Topics ran
 ge from fiction to food\, poetry to politics. Free with registration\, the
